    progression: ["Add load on the hard days when every set is clean at the top of the range.", "Keep light days light indefinitely. They are not a place to set records.", "If the second hard lower day is consistently poor, move it further from the first.", "Deload roughly every six weeks; five days accumulates fatigue faster than three."],
